                <syl /><neume facs="#m-9b2f8ab4-57b0-4a86-bb86-570413e2e6a1" type="clivis" xml:id="m-618601d6-170d-4c11-a5b8-09aedc709366">
                  <nc xml:id="m-848b679b-e734-42bb-9665-20aa729643d2" pname="a" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-ec1f186b-c661-451a-b8f6-cd940b4fa73c" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-52a6b80d-9fb4-4d49-951e-a1a2b5dde74e">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-dc3c40f6-e761-48f1-a1b2-bf32241dec5f" type="punctum" xml:id="m-d7348e59-ffd2-467e-8c25-7ee3e65a1c0a">
                  <nc xml:id="m-7708e30f-d6f1-4daf-9bee-2c1b45cb1104" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-1d82d92b-5275-4c9c-83d5-766d8dd09444" facs="#m-e3d950dd-8f88-494a-ad2d-c5e75912d28e" pname="g" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-0b43bea1-2c09-4380-b020-892f3cdb18af"><lg xml:id="m-8986d7ae-0314-4413-9890-85798fda477b"><l xml:id="m-e442e2b1-952c-469c-9424-2b102df0fa9f" facs="#m-9c50fcc4-130a-4647-b2f6-fa80223381e2" label="ambiguous">August s. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-1e486ee7-603d-4019-ac51-22c3d4f6de9b" facs="#m-82ddbcd7-e090-4d28-84af-22172a77935b" label="ambiguous">1584</l><l xml:id="m-b35393bd-6975-4d6f-b7ea-593164c23847" facs="#m-5c00c5e8-2c2f-4a76-a969-daa65411651f" label="lyrics-like">Epistle. Testíficor coram Deo. p. 1190.</l><l xml:id="m-43ae64f7-4fc5-4116-afad-fbde865a685f" facs="#m-c89c7444-1548-4078-9d4c-344b0330c7a0" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Jústus ut pálma. p. 1201. Allelúia, allelúia. V. Jústus</l><l xml:id="m-a6dc5b87-6ff0-495a-9858-22e4393898f7" facs="#m-fa0c73ea-51e9-482f-b57c-ed0a775d56da" label="lyrics-like">germinábit. p. 1192.</l><l xml:id="m-3c14121c-fe9f-44b1-ad70-8c811cc23e24" facs="#m-f273ee6f-6b87-4f30-8d84-7f41a1d84a9b" label="ambiguous">Gospel. Sint lumbi vestri. p. 1202.</l><l xml:id="m-429ca41e-25f5-476f-a77a-f4a3eb81a6e7" facs="#m-4cc232d1-be3c-4157-b4d9-e17fb43fcf06" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Véritas méa. p. 1203.</l><l xml:id="m-5fdea4bd-b485-46bf-a345-d6e67481cf6e" facs="#m-4191b5bd-76f7-4276-9e5c-13e5c3758bdf" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-09df9f41-daf3-4d79-94aa-71dfbb2b431c" facs="#m-ea11f7c0-ff72-4065-a072-34dfa1e05cc5" label="lyrics-like">Unera tibi, Dómine, dicáta! Domínici Confessóris tui, nobis pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-7978b9b0-04b0-4265-85e8-8e5718387c45" facs="#m-c4ca0d69-fcfb-43d9-8a9f-bc1e53ca508a" label="lyrics-like">310 sanctifica: ut méritis beáti (ficiant ad medélam. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-87817ab4-36da-477b-85a5-a8796edce342" facs="#m-7e800427-388f-4967-9e0c-d93bbae244c2" label="lyrics-like">Communton. Fidélis sérvus. p. 1185.</l><l xml:id="m-50a0ea93-6008-4d20-b5aa-356caf472343" facs="#m-6f52f940-ec59-4088-bcf0-30c2db1a51e8" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-bf025e1e-648c-4ffa-905e-86b563bc1e7c" facs="#m-b4174645-c7ca-432b-bc45-60455092c5ab" label="lyrics-like">vOncéde, quaésumus omnípotens! Dominici Confessóris tui patrocinio</l><l xml:id="m-f7dd5315-01aa-4ee4-9e0e-af15c229621d" facs="#m-44c3893c-64ce-4e65-9c65-d1784f6d6678" label="lyrics-like">U Deus: ut qui peccatórum no-l sublevémur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4562807f-b8ff-4368-ad91-40f900c91164" facs="#m-93ffcc50-11e5-4288-933f-4b7c7d61f18c" label="lyrics-like">strórum póndere prémimur, beáti</l><l xml:id="m-b2a62036-8e4b-496f-b43a-60b1715c59b7" facs="#m-b0e8d550-e2d4-478f-818a-f8073112e8ca" label="text-like">5. The Dedication of the Church of Our Lady of the Snow.</l><l xml:id="m-1ba036c6-a80e-4960-885f-b8a86f32bff6" facs="#m-a19cb8b3-74e5-433c-a160-018984fed625" label="ambiguous">Double Major.</l><l xml:id="m-06240157-f2ed-48af-a978-2fc1a719039c" facs="#m-a0b10420-ab83-436d-aca8-1fd65bb42270" label="text-like">At ist and and Vespers, all from the Common of Feasts of the B. V. M..</l><l xml:id="m-24e1b890-845a-4d2e-bba9-2e3e5fe91639" facs="#m-af9064f2-5924-4386-ba31-c414053c60da" label="ambiguous">p. 1254.</l><l xml:id="m-965258a6-a9aa-4384-a594-3cdd87a821b0" facs="#m-8120bf27-589f-4a20-b538-0a4ae34f9ae1" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Sálve sáncta párens. p. 1263. The Credo. is said. Prefnce of</l><l xml:id="m-a8464dcc-cba3-42e4-a687-2843c8595922" facs="#m-3587efaa-b04b-4bbd-ac72-8dbc0a947c92" label="lyrics-like">the B. V. M. Et te in Festivitáte. D. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-b0f82fd7-513a-4b75-a0e5-89c997028084" facs="#m-c44cd1bf-f8f0-4cab-91ed-ed55eab7d638" label="text-like">6. THE TRANSFIGURATION OF OUR LORD</l><l xml:id="m-23ac9395-b0c6-414b-8859-a8123b750390" facs="#m-7568af26-c411-4e99-8606-b621481b271d" label="ambiguous">JESUS CHRIST.</l><l xml:id="m-dbfb146c-2cc0-4887-9dc2-e700087499e4" facs="#m-d93b01cd-a76f-480b-9d4b-a30e8921cc76" label="text-like">Double of the Second Class.</l><l xml:id="m-f21dbfb4-2b02-4195-9d2e-04e9f4b591d4" facs="#m-3c910a5a-388c-44cf-bbc6-64249871ab98" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-3ab2cfac-7986-42b8-b019-9bc1c431a9c2" facs="#m-600936d0-3e0a-4e34-a5e0-934db154e9ad" label="text-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 1588, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-1c4515bb-f4ee-48ce-bd83-0c0aea9a5a50" facs="#m-6eaa0836-d05e-4036-bd69-736ffd4ba2be" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-fdd37978-720c-4d07-ae4d-d803830dce04" facs="#m-1f47f1de-4539-45dc-a845-cd6b1f1ddb3e" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.E</l><l xml:id="m-1ac96d16-8810-4755-9b69-e03fdeafab57" facs="#m-3e5cdcc7-b8ab-405e-a0c8-b37fc76b9139" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-8c7e732a-ff02-4ee5-a950-16991425d892" facs="#m-c56e6d2d-c561-4cfa-97e5-cf2f22be1214" label="lyrics-like">Hrístus Jé-sus“spléndor Pátris, et figú-ra sub¬</l><l xml:id="m-04183109-d77c-41c6-836d-5d59e944ed2b" facs="#m-23b5f0e1-202a-43e0-908d-1c928bfee813" label="lyrics-like">stánti-ae é-jus, pórtans ómni-a vérbo virtú-tis sú¬ ae,</l><l xml:id="m-d5c5dcb9-e4c4-42b2-9fbe-5e086683b357" facs="#m-e023f62c-174b-4306-9cb8-00f7fad0c7b0" label="lyrics-like">purga-ti-ónem pecca-tórum fá-ci-ens, in mónte excél¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>